* Subjects who meet all of the following criteria can be enrolled into the study:

  1. For all(Cohort 1+ 2):

     1. Aged 18 to 60 years old;
     2. The subject or legally authorized representative gives signed informed consent which includes compliance with the requirements and restrictions listed in the informed consent form (ICF) and in this protocol;
